### Pulse — Slice 3 API Tests (Owner: Member C)
### Organ matching, waitlist, pledge lifecycle, and staff dashboard stats.
### Run with VS Code REST Client (humao.rest-client) or Invoke-RestMethod in PowerShell.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### ============================================================
### 1. Authentication
### ============================================================

### 1a. Login as seeded staff (City Care Hospital, Pune — verified)
# @name staffLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "STAFF",
  "email": "staff.citycare@example.com",
  "password": "Pulse@123"
}

### Capture staff token
@staffToken = {{staffLogin.response.body.token}}

### 1b. Login as seeded donor (Aarav Shah, Pune, O+)
# @name donorLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "DONOR",
  "email": "aarav@example.com",
  "password": "Pulse@123"
}

### Capture donor token
@donorToken = {{donorLogin.response.body.token}}


### ============================================================
### 2. Donor Organ Pledges
### ============================================================

### 2a. List own organ pledges (Aarav should see his seeded Kidney pledge)
GET {{baseUrl}}/organs/pledges
Authorization: Bearer {{donorToken}}

### 2b. Pledge an additional organ (Cornea)
# @name newPledge
POST {{baseUrl}}/organs/pledges
Authorization: Bearer {{donorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organ_type": "Cornea"
}

### Capture new pledge ID
@corneaPledgeId = {{newPledge.response.body.organ_id}}

### 2c. Withdraw the new Cornea pledge
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/organs/pledges/{{corneaPledgeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{donorToken}}


### ============================================================
### 3. Staff Waitlist Management
### ============================================================

### 3a. Staff adds a patient to their hospital's organ waitlist
# @name addPatient
POST {{baseUrl}}/organs/waitlist
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patient_name": "Kishore Kumar",
  "organ_type": "Kidney",
  "blood_group": "O",
  "urgency_score": 8
}

### 3b. Staff views their hospital's ranked waitlist
GET {{baseUrl}}/organs/waitlist
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### ============================================================
### 4. Organ Matching & Proposal Confirmation
### ============================================================

### 4a. Staff lists available organ pledges across the network
### Privacy check: donor name and contact details MUST NOT be exposed
GET {{baseUrl}}/organs/pledges/available
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### 4b. Staff triggers organ matching for Aarav's Kidney (organ_id = 1)
### Expected: 3 ranked proposals
### Privacy check: Sunita Rao (Hospital 2) is masked as "Patient #2" for City Care staff
# @name runMatch
POST {{baseUrl}}/organs/pledges/1/match
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### Capture first proposal ID
@firstProposalId = {{runMatch.response.body[0].organ_match_id}}

### 4c. Staff confirms the first proposal (Ramesh Patil at City Care)
### Must return 200 { "ok": true }
POST {{baseUrl}}/organs/matches/{{firstProposalId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### 4d. Second confirmation of the same proposal must fail with 409 PROPOSAL_NOT_ACTIVE
POST {{baseUrl}}/organs/matches/{{firstProposalId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### ============================================================
### 5. Staff Dashboard Stats
### ============================================================

### 5a. Get staff dashboard counts
### Returns { open_critical_requests, eligible_donors, waitlist_size }
GET {{baseUrl}}/stats/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
